    "title": "Tiger Woods' girlfriend, Vanessa Trump, and daughters not involved in car crash: source",
    "text": "1/1 Continue watchingafter the adVisit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGE Tiger Woods’ girlfriend, Vanessa Trump, and her daughters Kai and Chloe, were not in the car with the golfer when he crashed his car on Friday, a source confirms to Page Six. Woods was involved a rollover car crash in Jupiter Island, Fla., on Friday, according to the Martin County Sheriff’s office. He was alone at the time of the crash, police later confirmed. Tiger Woods was involved in a rollover car accident while driving his Land Rover around 2 p.m. Friday in Florida. He is pictured above outside the car after the crash. AP The pro golfer allegedly attempted to pass a utility pressure cleaner truck and hit the “back end” of the truck’s trailer, forcing the trailer to roll over. (Pictured above is Tiger Woods’ car turned on its side following the crash on Friday). Shabba / BACKGRID He was unharmed in the accident and was able to climb his way out of his vehicle. AP In his Friday press conference, Martin County Sheriff John Budensiek revealed that Woods was driving a Land Rover when the accident took place around 2 p.m. ET. Woods, 50, was said to have attempted to pass a utility pressure cleaner truck, clipping the “back end” of the truck’s trailer, leading the car to roll over. At which point, the athlete crawled out of his vehicle. He was unharmed. As a result of the accident, Woods was arrested and charged with driving under the influence, property damage, and refusal to submit to a lawful test. He is currently being held at the Martin County Jail, and is expected to remain there for the next 8 hours, as mandated by Florida law. Woods’s girlfriend Vanessa Trump, as pictured above with the golfer, was not with him at the time of his car crash on Friday, according to a source. Twitter/tigerwoods The insider added that neither of Vanessa’s daughters, Kai (pictured above at the 2026 Jupiter Links GC tournament) or Chloe, were in the vehicle at the time of the accident. TGL Golf via Getty Images Authorities claimed Woods appeared to be under the influence of “some type of medication or drug.” He blew a zero on the breathalyzer test, and refused urinalysis. The pro golfer was first reported to have been secretly dating Vanessa, 48, in March 2025. At the time, a source exclusively told Page Six that the relationship was “not too serious” but was “heading in that direction.” “They have a lot in common. They’ve both gotten used to public scrutiny. They both know how to keep their private life private. They’re both parents,” the insider adds. Authorities claimed Woods appeared to have been under the influence of “some type of medication or drug” at the time of the accident. AFP via Getty Images The golfer has been charged with driving under the influence, property damage, and refusal to submit to a lawful test in light of the accident. Getty Images Want more celebrity and pop culture news? Start your day with Page Six Daily. Thanks for signing up! Shortly after reports of their relationship surfaced, Woods confirmed their romance by making things social media official. “Love is in the air and life is better with you by my side!” the pro golfer posted via X, along with two photos of himself cozying up to Donald Trump Jr.’s ex-wife. A year later, the pair appear to still be going strong. Earlier this week, the couple was seen packing on the PDA on Tuesday at a golf match in Florida. Woods confirmed his romance with Trump (both pictured above snuggled up together) in March 2025 after it was reported that the pair had been secretly dating since November 2024. Twitter/tigerwoods The couple was seen earlier this week packing on the PDA at the Jupiter Links GC Tournament, as pictured above. GREG LOVETT/PALM BEACH POST / USA TODAY NETWORK via Imagn Images In addition to her daughters, Vanessa is also mom to sons Donald III, Tristan and Spencer — all of whom, she welcomed with her ex-husband. Woods shares two children — daughter Sam Alexis and son Charlie Axel — with his ex-wife, Elin Nordegren. Woods was involved in multiple past car accidents, including another rollover crash where he sustained serious injuries while driving in California in February 2021.",
